request.description:
Get all available venue-type categories (restaurant, pub, cinema, etc.). Use this endpoint to populate dropdowns or filters when creating/editing venues.

**No venue_id required** - returns the complete list of venue types.

**Response includes:**
- categories_group: Group information (Venue type)
- categories: Array of all venue-type categories with id, name, slug, icon_key, display_order

**Available venue types:**
- Restaurant, Pub, Cinema, Club, Bar, Cafe, Hotel, Theater, Concert hall, Gallery, Sports venue, Other

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "categories_group": {
      "id": "group_uuid",
      "name": "Venue type",
      "slug": "venue-categories"
    },
    "categories": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "name": "Restaurant",
        "slug": "venue_restaurant",
        "icon_key": "restaurant",
        "display_order": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "uuid2",
        "name": "Pub",
        "slug": "venue_pub",
        "icon_key": "pub",
        "display_order": 1
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Get venue-type categories (restaurant, pub, cinema, etc.) with subscribed flag for a specific venue.

**Returns only venue-type categories** (not event categories). Shows which categories are currently assigned to this venue.

**Response includes:**
- venue_id: Venue ID
- categories_groups: Single group "Venue type" with all venue-type categories
- subscribed_category_ids: Array of category IDs that are currently assigned to this venue

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "venue_id": "uuid",
    "categories_groups": [
      {
        "id": "group_uuid",
        "name": "Venue type",
        "slug": "venue-categories",
        "categories": [
          {
            "id": "uuid",
            "name": "Restaurant",
            "slug": "venue_restaurant",
            "icon_key": "restaurant",
            "subscribed": true
          },
          {
            "id": "uuid2",
            "name": "Pub",
            "slug": "venue_pub",
            "icon_key": "pub",
            "subscribed": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "subscribed_category_ids": ["uuid"]
  }
}
```

**Note:** Only venue owner or admin can manage venue categories.

