request.description:
Bulk add multiple artists to an event (transactional - all or nothing). Each artist: **artist_id** (linked User) OR **artist_name** (free-form text).

**Important:** Transactional - if ANY artist fails, NONE are added.

**Simple Format (artist_ids only, uses event times):**
```json
{
  "artist_ids": ["uuid1", "uuid2"]
}
```

**Detailed Format (artist_id or artist_name per item):**
```json
{
  "artists": [
    { "artist_id": "uuid1", "description": "Opening act" },
    { "artist_name": "DJ Unknown", "description": "TBA" }
  ]
}
```

**Response:** event_id, artists array, count

